== Installation ==

1. Install Woolementor using the native Plugin installer, or download the zip and extract it in the wp-content/plugins/ directory.
2. Activate the plugin through the ‘Plugins’ admin menu.
3. Set conditiona from the Elementor control under Advanced tab.

Please [reach out to us](https://help.codexpert.io/?utm_campaign=wporg) if you need any help.

== Frequently Asked Questions ==

= Does it require Elementor? =

Yes. You need to have Elementor activated in order to use this plugin.

= Does it require Elementor Pro? =

No, it doesn't.

= Is it compatible with any WordPress Theme? =

Yes, it’s compatible with any WordPress themes as long as it works with Elementor.

= Can I show my content only to the WooCommerce customers? =

You need to install the [WooCommerce extension](https://codexpert.io/product/restrict-elementor-widgets/rew-wc/?utm_campaign=plugin-uri) to achieve this.

= My question is not answered here =

Please [reach out to us](https://help.codexpert.io/?utm_campaign=wporg). We're always happy to help.

